WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.140
Main gets dragged into a dubious plot

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.010
and lets her mana go berserk.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:12.300
Lord Sylvester, you liar.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.770
You promised to protect me.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.280
Main, where did you get that?

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.070
He gave it to me after he went hunting.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.910
He said it was a protective charm.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.690
I see.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.410
That is a powerful protective charm indeed.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.280
What do you mean by that?

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:30.650
That's only...

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:35.420
if you are prepared to become 
Sylvester's daughter.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.620
If that is how to save everyone...

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.680
Then I will proceed.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.470
If you've made up your mind...

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:49.800
Main, pray to the wind and protect them.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.750
Protect them from my mana.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.020
<i>Everyone here... My family...</i>

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.710
<i>I'm going to protect them!</i>

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.790
Lord Karstedt!

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.860
Sorry to keep you waiting, Main.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.890
Lord Sylvester!

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:26.300
Ferdinand, that's enough. Well done.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.300
Main, you may put down your shield as well.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:38.070
<i>Wait. Is the head priest's
rank lower than his?</i>

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:42.070
Oh, Sylvester! You came at the perfect time!

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.260
What is this mess?

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.040
Let's hear what's going on...

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:48.910
Uncle.

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:49.920
What?

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.410
And who's that supposed to be?

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:56.120
This is Aub Ehrenfest.

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:58.500
H-He couldn't be...

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.010
Aub... Ehrenfest?

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:04.960
Main, that's the lord.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:06.620
The lord?

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:09.470
Huh?

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:10.680
What?

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:17.200
What?!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.500
<b>Ascendance of a Bookworm</b>

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.010
<b>Ascendance of a Bookworm</b>

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:58.000
<b>Chapter Thirty-Six
Blessing</b>

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:01.250
Otto, Lutz, what happened?

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:06.200
And so Mister Gunther and 
Main went to the cathedral.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:09.740
Come to think of it, Main 
said something strange.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:12.780
She said we needed to call for 
help in that situation.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.140
And?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.890
She used her blood seal on the 
black stone hanging from her neck.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.400
Damn it! It's too early for that!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.410
Huh?

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:28.310
Main's okay, right?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:33.210
Main... will be okay.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.050
You may look up.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:52.670
Is there anything you'd like 
to say, Count Bindewald?

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:56.170
I'd like you to punish that commoner!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:58.190
Commoner, you say?

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:01.200
This little brat named Main!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:04.720
She used her magic against a noble!

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.040
She is truly a dangerous, 
treacherous little commoner!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:11.010
You seem to have the wrong 
idea about something.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.860
This girl you call a commoner

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.550
is my adopted daughter.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.030
Absurd!

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.130
Main.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.500
The proof...

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:28.800
is right here.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.920
And what's that?

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:37.310
A magic item that finalizes a contract 
once a blood seal is used.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:41.570
Do you understand now?
 Main is already my daughter.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:46.650
Which would mean that you attacked a 
relative of the lord of this domain.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.830
No...

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:54.330
Count Bindewald, you not only 
entered this city illegally,

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.330
but you attacked its lord's daughter 
as well as her knight bodyguard.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.180
You will be taken into custody. Seize him!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:12.040
I will sentence you once all of 
your crimes have become clear.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:14.520
Uncle.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.060
Sylvester!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.830
I knew none of this!

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.720
This was all devised by Count Bindewald!

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:24.560
I just did what I was told!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.800
You're making excuses?

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.060
That's rather unsightly, Uncle.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.250
It's the truth! You have 
to believe me, Sylvester!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.830
I didn't do anything wrong!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.590
Tell that cur to untie me at once!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.240
And now calling him a cur...

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.590
My little brother.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:44.840
<i>Little brother?</i>

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.460
<i>These two are brothers?</i>

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:55.380
Who cares about a younger brother 
who has some whore as a mother?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.840
I ask that you refrain from insults.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:04.360
Though our mothers are different, 
he is still my precious little brother.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.940
Don't let him fool you, Sylvester!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:11.120
I'm sure he's the one who coaxed 
you into adopting Main, as well!

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:15.110
Nullify this adoption at once! 
This is my warning as your uncle!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:22.250
You are my precious little nephew! 
I wish you no misfortune!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.730
Sylvester! I'm...

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:29.510
I'm saying this for your own good!

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.880
And now crocodile tears...

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.770
I'm worried about you from 
the bottom of my heart!

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:39.630
As the lord, I will cast aside any 
attachment I have for you as a relative,

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:41.260
and place judgment upon you.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.670
Uncle, you went too far.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.120
I cannot turn a blind eye any longer.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.300
This commotion you caused

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.620
is worthy of the death penalty.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:53.880
What?!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.870
That goes for all of your accomplices, too.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.740
Take him away!

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:02.630
Sylvester!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.350
Lady Main, please take care of Dirk for me.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.110
Delia...

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.510
Why weren't you there to help me?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:23.780
Lord Sylvester, I have 
a favor to ask of you.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.400
Name it.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.270
Would you consider sparing Delia?

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:29.600
And why is that?

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.490
Delia was only deceived.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.400
I don't believe she had any 
involvement in their evil deeds.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:39.390
Be that as it may, if she was 
involved in this incident,

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.530
she must face some punishment.

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:48.120
As the daughter of the lord, 
you may decide her punishment.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.670
Let's see what you decide.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:58.180
For her punishment, I order that 
Delia return to the orphanage.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.390
You will be no one's attendant.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.850
You will spend the rest of your life taking 
care of Dirk and all of the other orphans.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.310
That is your duty from now on, Delia.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.560
Thank you kindly.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.070
Are you Main's biological father?

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:24.320
Yes. My name is Gunther.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.330
We will now finalize this 
contract for the adoption.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.240
Go summon your family.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.600
Yes, sire.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.590
Thank you very much.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.990
Dad, what happened to your arm?

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:46.230
It's no big deal. Main's 
waiting for us. Let's go.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:49.950
Mister Gunther, where's Main?

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.550
I promise I'll explain 
everything to you later.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:53.690
Just wait for me.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.890
Perhaps you should get some rest.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:05.190
I'm fine.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.960
You're so inflexible, Fran.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.600
I could say the same about you, Arno.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:14.470
Why didn't you tell me that the head 
priest was in his hidden room?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.780
You may take your leave.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:27.360
Main, let's talk about your future.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:30.950
Am I going to become Lord 
Karstedt's daughter first

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:33.920
and then become yours, Lord Sylvester?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.100
Well, a former commoner girl

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:44.320
being adopted is quite different 
from a noble girl being adopted.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:50.490
You are the beloved daughter of Lord 
Karstedt's third wife, who perished.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.590
<i>Talk about illegally messing with 
someone's family register.</i>

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.620
As for the Gilberta Company...

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:59.760
I considered having them close up shop...

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:00.760
What?!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.780
But they are absolutely necessary 
to keep the printing business

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:07.150
as one of this city's industries.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:10.010
I will let you continue your 
relationship with them.

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:13.140
Thank you kindly.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.890
Regarding your birth family...

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.650
You are going to become 
the daughter of the lord.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.040
Your name will change.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.040
Seeing your family...

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:27.030
will be prohibited from now on.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:32.960
<b>Ascendance of a
 Bookworm</b>

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:39.050
<b>Ascendance of a
 Bookworm</b>

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.500
Come in.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.170
Main!

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.650
Tuuli!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.150
Main, are you okay?

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:55.380
The look on Dad's face was scary when
he came to get me, and he was injured.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.730
And now even Mom and Kamil
have to come to the cathedral...

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:03.920
I was really scared that something 
might've happened to you.

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:07.280
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:11.170
Tuuli, you need to bow, as well.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.110
Huh?

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:22.610
In order to conclude this
incident without further issue,

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.170
it has been decided that 
Main will be adopted by me.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.680
The commoner Main is now dead.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:31.690
Understood.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.690
Is this my fault?

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:34.810
It's not.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.810
But then why...

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.320
Dad must've known.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:46.270
All of you are obstacles to Main
becoming your lord's daughter.

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.950
I thought of having all of 
you dealt with, too.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.800
But then Main would probably go berserk,

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.210
so I'm allowing all of you to live.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:02.750
But I cannot allow you to see 
her as her family any longer.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:07.350
Once you sign the contract, I will 
allow you to continue seeing her.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:09.020
Main, read it to them.

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:17.760
"You are to announce to everyone 
around you that Main has died."

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:21.080
"If you are ever to encounter 
Main from now on,

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.650
you will not claim to be her family."

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:29.900
"You will treat Main as a noble."

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:33.710
Those are the terms of this contract.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:43.250
So if I sign this contract, you 
won't be my little sister anymore?

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:44.550
Mm...

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.350
But I don't want that!

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.550
I don't want this either,

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.460
but I don't want to put you 
in danger anymore, Tuuli.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.980
Something might happen to Mom or Kamil next.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.090
I don't want to put my 
family in danger anymore.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:13:59.470
But...

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.910
Even if we're not family anymore...

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.910
Even if I can't call you 
my big sister anymore...

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.360
I still want to be able 
to see your face, Tuuli!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:17.610
I'll keep doing my best to make picture 
books and toys for you and Kamil, Tuuli.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:19.490
So please... let me at least see you.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.580
Main, please don't cry.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:27.170
I promise I'll do my best to learn how to 
read, so I can read these books you're making.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:31.250
Tuuli, once you become a 
professional seamstress,

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:34.390
I'll send you my clothing orders, 
so I want you to make them.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.910
I promise you. I'll make you 
all your clothes, Main.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.850
I love you, Tuuli.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.180
I couldn't be prouder of my older sister.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.410
Main...

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.520
You're leaving your parents far too early.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.520
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:01.780
You get sick easily, so 
you need to be careful.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.480
Make sure you listen to everyone around you,

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.460
so you don't cause them any trouble.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.920
Don't go running off on your own.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:10.920
Make sure you help out when you can,

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.460
and make sure you don't 
rely too much on others.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:15.110
<i>I usually just listen and say, 
"Yeah, yeah," to all of this,</i>

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:17.920
<i>but knowing I won't hear 
this anymore is just...</i>

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:26.520
I love you, my dear little Main.

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:29.600
I love you, too, Mom.

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:32.500
Mom, do you want me to 
write your name for you?

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:36.070
I've been practicing how to write, as well.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:41.380
Dad, is it okay if I hold Kamil?

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:47.850
I'm going to be making picture books just 
for you, so make sure you read them, okay?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.410
Is your arm okay, Dad?

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.220
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.970
I'm sorry. This is all my fault.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:03.720
And I'm sorry that I couldn't 
protect you, Main.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:08.320
No, you always protected me, Dad.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:13.370
If I ever get married, I want to marry 
someone who'll protect me just like you.

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:17.670
You're just supposed to say that 
you want to marry me, Main.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.920
I want to marry you, Dad!

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:25.000
I've always wanted my 
daughter to say that to me,

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:30.560
but now that my wish came true, 
my daughter's leaving me...

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:32.880
This is too much to bear.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:37.680
My name is going to change, and I won't 
be able to call you "Dad" anymore,

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.500
but I'll always be your daughter.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.390
I'll protect this whole city.

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.530
The whole city, eh?

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.770
Main, restrain yourself!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:57.380
No, I need to use this mana,

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:00.740
because it was born from the 
love that I have for my family.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:04.090
I'm going to use it for my family!

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.170
Main...

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.050
The king and queen of the Gods, 
who rule upon the sky so high,

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:11.920
are the Gods of Darkness and 
Light, husband and wife.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:16.270
The Eternal Five that 
rule upon this land...

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:23.040
The Goddess of Water, Fruhtrane.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.000
The God of Fire, Leidenschaft.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.680
The Goddess of Wind, Schutzaria.

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.940
The Goddess of Earth, Geduldh.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:35.590
The God of Life, Ewigleben.

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:39.320
Hear my prayers and bless us.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.820
I offer you my heart.

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:44.330
I offer you my prayers and gratitude...

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.800
Please repay them with 
your divine protection!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.200
This is...

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.090
Give us the power to heal pain.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.590
My wound... is all better?

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:06.520
The power to continue toward our goals.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.780
The power to ward off evil.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.270
The power to endure hardship.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.270
Bless my loved ones with these powers.

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:29.260
This is my last blessing to all of you.

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:36.290
Tuuli.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:39.890
Kamil.

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.300
Mom.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:46.810
Dad.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.030
Everyone...

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.900
I love you.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.120
The contract spell is now complete.

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.130
The one who stands before 
you now is Rozemyne.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.700
She is the daughter of an upper-class noble.

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.340
If you'll excuse us.

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:34.200
May you stay well and healthy.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.520
Goodbye...

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:42.390
Thank you very much for coming by today.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:47.340
I pray that we get to meet again 
from the bottom of my heart.

00:22:03.810 --> 00:22:06.430
Morning, Lutz. Did something happen?

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:09.850
I guess Main really isn't here.

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:14.470
No, Main is gone.

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:17.820
If you've got time to cry 
about it, get to work!

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:20.380
I don't care if it's Main or Rozemyne.

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:22.260
What does she desire more than anything?

00:22:22.260 --> 00:22:23.210
Books!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.040
Precisely!

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:27.310
There's only one thing we need to do.

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:29.890
And that's business!

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:34.350
In order to ensure she lives up to everything 
that being the daughter of the lord entails,

00:22:34.350 --> 00:22:36.610
I'll need you to guide her 
as sternly as possible.

00:22:36.610 --> 00:22:38.000
As you wish.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.340
I will give this task my all.

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:45.030
I'm going to be able to make hair 
accessories at Missus Corinna's!

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:47.350
That must be thanks to Main's blessing.

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:49.040
I'm home!

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:52.340
I ran into Gil at the square and was 
able to find out how Main's been doing.

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:53.520
Oh, thank goodness.

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:55.590
Hurry up and tell us, Dad!

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:04.610
Your job will be to spread the printing business
as a new industry throughout this domain,

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:05.930
Rozemyne.

00:23:06.300 --> 00:23:07.090
I understand.

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:10.510
<i>I'm going to protect everyone.</i>

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:14.910
<i>And to do so, I'm going to 
create even more books!</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Illustration by: Suzuka
